msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:14
#: 52fa7b7c276a4e0295974a09b8b4a714
msgid "The article is intended primarily for developers who want to test new Plane builds and bug fixes using SITL and *MAVProxy*. It shows how to take off, run missions, fly in ``GUIDED`` mode, set a geofence, and perform a number of other basic testing tasks."
msgstr ""

